cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (via the DOI below) and the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "SPeCTRA: Stealthy PPO-enhanced Coordinated Trigger Attack against Robust Federated Aggregation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of SPeCTRA, a PPO-driven backdoor attack on federated
  learning. A reinforcement-learning agent adapts a frequency-domain phase trigger
  in the YCbCr chrominance channels under Hermitian symmetry, evading eight
  Byzantine-robust and backdoor-specific aggregation defenses across SVHN,
  CIFAR-10, and Fashion-MNIST.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/shohelex/spectra-federated-backdoor"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23850774"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-01"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - backdoor attack
  - reinforcement learning
  - proximal policy optimization
  - Byzantine-robust aggregation
  - frequency-domain trigger

